OL,3,CPedal power! Artist relies on public
OL,4,Cto live-stitch Brighton's Royal
OL,5,CPavilion
OL,7,FVisitors to Brighton's Royal Pavilion
OL,8,Fhave been helping to create a striking
OL,9,Flive artwork - by pedalling a
OL,10,Fstationary bike.
OL,12,FTextile artist Harriet Riddell, who
OL,13,Fworks under the creative name
OL,14,FInStitchYou, has spent two days using
OL,15,Ffreehand machine embroidery to capture
OL,16,Fa detailed portrait of George IV's
OL,17,Fhistoric royal palace from life.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
