OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786110488
OL,3,CPedal power! Artist relies on public
OL,4,Cto live-stitch Brighton's Royal
OL,5,CPavilion
OL,7,F"Every person who hops on the bike
OL,8,Fbrings energy to the artwork in more
OL,9,Fways than one, helping power my sewing
OL,10,Fmachine while sharing stories and
OL,11,Fobservations that become part of the
OL,12,Fexperience.
OL,14,F"The Royal Pavilion is one of the most
OL,15,Fstunning and distinctive buildings in
OL,16,Fthe UK, and I couldn't wait to see the
OL,17,FBrighton community bring it to life on
OL,18,Fcanvas through pedal power."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
